ury Modern Armchair', the Browse grid immediately updated to '8 items available' and neither listing appears in the grid anymore, confirming sold and deleted listings are excluded from the buyer-facing browse view (and therefore cannot be discovered to add to cart or send a purchase request).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-5\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Registered Test Seller / testseller_qa1@example.com / password123 / Seattle, WA. Got toast \\\"Account created successfully!\\\" and nav now shows signed-in user \\\"Test Seller\\\" with Sell button.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-6\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Applied Furniture category filter alone -> 2 items (both furniture). Combined with Like New condition filter -> correctly intersected to 0 items ('No items found', Clear all filters shown). Cleared filters -> restored 8 items. Applied 'Price: Low to High' sort -> items correctly ordered $35,$55,$65,$95,$125,$175,$180,$320. Combined Furniture filter + Price Low-to-High sort simultaneously -> correctly showed only the 2 furniture items in ascending price order ($175, $320), confirming filters and sort compose correctly.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-7\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Searched 'WOOD' (uppercase) -> matched titles 'Reclaimed Wood Bookshelf' and 'Kids Wooden Train Set' (2 items), confirming case-insensitive title search. Searched 'barn' (lowercase, word only present in description) -> matched only 'Reclaimed Wood Bookshelf' (1 item) via description text. Searched 'PORTLAND' (uppercase, matches only location field) -> matched 3 items all located in 'Portland, OR'. Clearing the search box restored the full unfiltered list of 8 available items.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-8\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"As Emma, added James Wilson's listing 'Reclaimed Wood Bookshelf' (prod-10, $320) to cart via Add to Cart button. Cart page (/cart) shows the item with photo, title (linked to product), location 'Portland, OR', price $320, and item count '1 item'. Cart total correctly shows $320.00 matching the single item's price.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-9\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"On prod-10 (Reclaimed Wood Bookshelf, owned by James Wilson, not Emma), clicked Message Seller, dialog 'Send a message to James Wilson' opened with Send Message button disabled until text entered. Typed a non-empty message, button became enabled, clicked it, dialog closed, and toast 'Message sent to seller!' appeared confirming the request.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-21\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Category page navigation does not apply category filter to results\", \"actual\": \"On /categories, 'Furniture' category card correctly displayed count '2 items' (matching the actual furniture listings). Clicking it navigated to /?category=furniture, but the Browse page ignored the category query param: it displayed 'Browse All Items' with '8 items available' (the full unfiltered catalog) and the Furniture checkbox in the sidebar filter panel was NOT checked/applied. Expected: navigating from a category card should filter results to that category (2 furniture items) with a matching count, consistent with what the category card itself displayed.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-22\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"No seller-facing view for received purchase requests or buyer messages\", \"actual\": \"As a buyer (Emma), sending a cart purchase request to seller James Wilson (prod-10) produced a buyer-side confirmation toast 'Purchase requests sent to sellers!', and sending a direct message via 'Message Seller' produced 'Message sent to seller!'. However, no UI surface exists for the seller to view these: the account dropdown menu offers only 'My Profile' (navigates to /profile which renders a 404 'Page not found'), 'My Listings' (shows only View/Mark Sold/Delete per listing with no indication of requests or messages received), and there is no notifications/inbox icon in the nav. Sellers therefore have no way to view purchase requests or buyer messages sent to them.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-10\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Attempted login with an email not registered in the current session (testseller_qa1@example.com). Got toast \\\"Invalid credentials. Try: emma@example.com\\\", stayed on /login page, nav still shows Log in/Sign up (no session created).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-11\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Registered qa.buyer.test2@example.com, then attempted to register again using case-variant \\\"QA.Buyer.Test2@Example.com\\\". Registration blocked: toast \\\"An account with this email already exists\\\", stayed on /register, no navigation/session change (original account preserved).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-12\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Password not verified on login\", \"actual\": \"Registered a fresh account (qa.buyer.test2@example.com) with password \\\"correctpass1\\\". After logging out, signing in with the same email but an incorrect password \\\"wrongpassword999\\\" succeeded: toast \\\"Welcome back!\\\" appeared and nav showed the authenticated \\\"QA Buyer\\\" session. Also observed same behavior with demo account emma@example.com and a wrong password (login page itself notes \\\"(any password works)\\\"). Incorrect passwords are not rejected.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-13\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Logged in as Emma Green. Own listing (prod-1, Mid-Century Modern Armchair) detail page shows 'Manage Your Listings' button and no Add to Cart/Message Seller buttons. Other seller's listing (prod-10, Reclaimed Wood Bookshelf, owned by James Wilson) detail page shows 'Add to Cart' and 'Message Seller' buttons only, with no manage/edit/delete options exposed.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-14\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Submitting fully empty form blocked (native required validation on title/description/price/location). With text fields filled but no photo/category/condition: toast \\\"Please fill in all required fields\\\". With category+condition added but no photo: toast \\\"Please add at least one image\\\". No listing created in any case (stayed on /create-listing).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-15\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Price field is type=number min=0. Entering -25 and submitting kept user on /create-listing with no listing created (native rangeUnderflow validation blocks submit). Attempting to type non-numeric text \\\"abc\\\" into the field was rejected outright by the number input.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-23\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"While logged out, clicking \\\"Add to Cart\\\" on a product detail page redirected to /login with toast \\\"Please log in to add items to your cart\\\". (Earlier, attempting to view /create-listing, /my-listings while unauthenticated similarly required login; Sell/cart/manage actions are hidden from nav when logged out.)\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-16\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Duplicate email registration attempt immediately produced visible toast \\\"An account with this email already exists\\\" without page reload, and the registration form remained populated with the entered values for correction (Full Name, Email, Password, Location fields all retained).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-17\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Typing into the search box (no submit/enter pressed) updated the 'N items available' count and the results grid instantly for each query (WOOD->2, barn->1, PORTLAND->3, cleared->8), with no