      "result": "All 23 checklist items have now been recorded and verified complete. Here's the final QA testing summary for ReVive (http://localhost:6023/):\n\n## Test Results: 23/23 items recorded — 4 FAILs, 19 PASSes\n\n### FAILures found:\n1. **FT-2** — No edit-listing functionality exists at all (only View/Mark Sold/Delete on My Listings; no edit form/route anywhere).\n2. **FT-21** — Category browsing is broken: clicking a category card on /categories navigates to `/?category=X` but the Browse page ignores the query param and shows the full unfiltered catalog instead of the filtered category results.\n3. **FT-22** — No seller-facing view exists for received purchase requests or buyer messages. Buyers get send-confirmation toasts, but sellers have no inbox/notifications UI to see them; the \"My Profile\" menu item even 404s.\n4. **CS-12** — Password is not verified at login; any password (including deliberately wrong ones) succeeds for both demo and freshly-registered non-demo accounts, effectively bypassing authentication.\n\n### Passing highlights:\n- Listing creation with full field validation (required fields, image requirement, non-negative price enforcement via native number input)\n- Mark Sold/Available toggle and Delete-with-confirmation both work correctly\n- Sold/deleted listings correctly disappear from Browse\n- Cart flow (add to cart → view cart → send purchase request) works end-to-end with correct totals\n- Message Seller flow works with proper empty-state validation and confirmation\n- Search is case-insensitive across title/description/location and updates live without submission\n- Filters (category/condition) combine correctly (AND logic) and compose properly with sorting; all update live\n- Owner vs. non-owner UI correctly gates management actions vs. buyer actions\n- Listing detail pages consistently show all required fields, including explicit \"no longer available\" messaging for sold items\n- Duplicate-registration and unauthenticated-cart-access flows handled correctly with immediate, non-disruptive feedback\n\nAll findings have been persisted via `record_result` and confirmed complete via `get_result_progress` (23/23, no missing IDs).",
